# Allowlist: only the product is tracked. Anything else you place at the root
# (your instance, your project repos, scratch folders) is invisible to this
# repo's git.
/*
!/framework/
!/tools/
!/LIFTOFF.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes

# .claude ships ONLY its skills (auto-discovered on clone); session-local
# files (settings.local.json, caches) must never be tracked.
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/

# operator-local; never ships
tools/leak-sweep.private.txt

# the operator's instance, in full and with no exceptions (allowlist already
# excludes; restated AFTER it so a stray negation up there cannot undo it).
# Why, and how to version it privately: framework/task-board.md.
/_command/

# founder's internal project docs (allowlist already excludes; explicit for safety)
.project/

# optional fronts/ container: host your project repos here (moved or copied in),
# each keeping its own git, invisible to this repo via the allowlist. Explicit
# for clarity. See framework/task-board.md (front placement).
fronts/

# ticket payloads, for a ticket folder in a TRACKED tree (never _command/, already
# excluded above; this is framework/examples/ and any private instance repo).
# Exclude the folder's contents, re-include the two worth versioning - naming the
# payload dirs instead would fail open on the first name nobody thought of. Same
# shape as the .claude/ rule above. Scope is the children of any directory named
# tasks, one level down, so keep product code out of there.
**/tasks/*/*
!**/tasks/*/ticket.md
!**/tasks/*/scripts/

# retired payload location (MC-003, superseded by MC-005). Kept ignored because an
# instance whose spokes still name it lives outside this repo's reach.
.tickets/

# generated by the optional docs-viewer skill (any depth)
node_modules/
.docs-viewer-cache/
